# 统一换行符策略（与 .editorconfig 配套）
#
# 目的：
#   1. 仓库内文本文件一律以 LF 存储，Windows 检出时由 Git 按规则转换；
#   2. 避免"改了一行却整文件 diff"和 `LF will be replaced by CRLF` 告警刷屏；
#   3. 明确二进制文件，防止 Git 误做文本合并。

* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 脚本必须保留 CRLF，否则 cmd 解析异常
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 明确的二进制类型
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.jar binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.exe binary
*.apk binary
*.pdf binary

# 语言级 diff 提示
*.java diff=java
*.md diff=markdown
*.sql linguist-language=SQL
